{"info": {"address1": "Plot No. 2-B", "address2": "Sector-126 District Gautam Budh Nagar", "city": "Noida", "zip": "201304", "country": "India", "phone": "91 12 0686 0000", "fax": "91 12 0309 0111", "website": "https://www.indiaglycols.com", "industry": "Chemicals", "industryKey": "chemicals", "industryDisp": "Chemicals", "sector": "Basic Materials", "sectorKey": "basic-materials", "sectorDisp": "Basic Materials", "longBusinessSummary": "India Glycols Limited, a green petrochemical company, manufactures and sells industrial chemicals in India. It operates through Bio-based Specialities and Performance Chemicals, Potable Spirits, and Ennature Biopharma segments. The company offers bio mono ethylene, di ethylene, and tri ethylene glycols; ethyl/butyl glycol ethers and acetates, and brake fluids; bio-polymers comprising guar and natural gums; biofuels; specialty chemicals, such as plasticisers, oil fields chemicals, bio-amines, methyl soyate, MDEA and MDEA derivatives, bio-potash granules, and C-Smart specialty products; molasses and grain based extra neutral alcohol; and specialty gases, including industrial and medical oxygen, food grade and industrial carbon dioxide, liquid argon and nitrogen, ethylene oxide, and bio ethylene oxide. It also provides Indian made foreign liquor, such as whiskey under Soulmate Blu and Single Reserve brands; vodka under Amazing brand; and rum under Zumba and Beach House XXX brands, as well as economy spirits under Bunty brand, and branded country liquor. In addition, the company offers natural active pharmaceutical ingredients, nutraceuticals, standardized botanical extracts, and nicotine derivatives. Further, its products find applications in pharma and healthcare; textiles; automotive; personal care; industrial and manufacturing; paints and coatings; oil and gas; food ingredients; packaging; potable spirits; and other various industries. The company also exports its products. The company was formerly known as UP Glycols Limited and changed its name to India Glycols Limited in August 1986. India Glycols Limited was incorporated in 1983 and is headquartered in Noida, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Uma Shankar Bhartia", "age": 72, "title": "Chairman & MD", "yearBorn": 1953, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 152498841, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Rupark  Sarswat", "age": 53, "title": "Chief Executive Officer", "yearBorn": 1972, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Anand  Singhal FCA", "age": 59, "title": "Chief Financial Officer", "yearBorn": 1966, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Atul  Govil", "title": "CTO and Head of SAP & IT", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ankur  Jain", "age": 50, "title": "Head of Legal, Compliance Officer & Company Secretary", "yearBorn": 1975, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Pragya Bhartia Barwale", "age": 43, "title": "Executive Director", "yearBorn": 1982, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 60229596, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Alok  Singhal", "age": 55, "title": "Whole-time Director", "yearBorn": 1970, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 8969211, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sudhir  Agarwal", "age": 63, "title": "President Operations", "yearBorn": 1962, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 7509089, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Madhup  Misra", "age": 62, "title": "Head  of Account & Admin", "yearBorn": 1963, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Dev Chander Jha", "age": 46, "title": "Chief Human Resource Officer", "yearBorn": 1979, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}], "compensati